@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title DELETE /api/workspace/v1/push_devices/{registration_uuid}
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "设备 push-关于通知 PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "内部域名 outbox" as OUT
queue "delivery_snapshot_event\ninternal/no public derivative" as TASK
Client -> API: DELETE UUID 登记情况
API -> DB: BEGIN; 如果存在的话,请在指定区域中删除
API -> OUT: 只要有变化,才可以添加内删除
API -> DB: COMMIT
OUT -> TASK: immutable delivery_snapshot_event(outbox_event_uuid)
note right of TASK: effect guard; 没有完成 public event row
API --> Client: 204 没有答案
@enduml
